      "created_at": "2018-04-11T12:36:23Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-04-11T12:36:23Z",
      "body": "I agree that this is a good idea, but I also agree with Alec that it makes sense only if the user has no historical data. Because if they do have some historical data, that data would be added to the Admin's own historical data.\r\n\r\nSo in my view it would have be something like an auto-prune for completely inactive accounts.",
